2. I will skip segments that are empty after trimming so empty input and extra commas produce no scores.
3. For each remaining segment I will validate an optional leading sign followed by at least one digit, throwing std::invalid_argument otherwise.
4. I will convert the validated digits to an int while checking range, then append each score to the result in order.

Here are the diffs for those changes:

