3. To generate palindromic anagrams, I count letters, reject more than one odd count, build the half multiset, backtrack over unique half-permutations, and mirror each half around the optional middle character.
4. I group anagrams by sorting each normalized word into a signature, deduplicating normalized words within each signature, keeping only groups with at least two distinct words, and sorting words and groups lexicographically.
